`developer.vpbank.com` — a=7, b=6, t=7 (Berlin Group PSD2, SCA REDIRECT, UUID consents), g=10 (no gate), c=3, f=10 → 0.25·7+0.25·6+0.15·7+0.15·10+0.10·3+0.10·10 = **7.10**
