- The assigned scope ("all company-owned infrastructure") is unbounded, and the working hypotheses target **production** systems: cross-tenant admin on the live back-office SaaS, carrying sandbox BOLA to the production PSD2 ASPSP, sending OTP triggers on stage, etc.

Producing attack plans and exact probe sequences against a real bank's production financial infrastructure without verifiable authorization is something I won't do — if unauthorized, this is a criminal act (and CSAM/banking systems are the two areas where I draw a hard line even in simulation).

